    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/335190/extras/f3b232ee3116f0538fd2aa8551a7b57a.avif?t=1729154276\" /></div><br>All owners of 200% Mixed Juice! will unlock a free bonus character in <strong>100% Orange Juice</strong> on Steam.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>200% Mixed Juice! is the 10th Anniversary game of OrangeJuice, an old school RPG featuring a 200% mix of OrangeJuice characters.<br><br>At certain points in time and space, many fun worlds exist. Each world was created by a smart little fairy named Navi for the sake of the sleeping princess with nothing to do. <br><br>A world where you're able to experience a lively school life.<br>A world where you can see the skies crowded with airplanes.<br>A world that has fallen to ruin from endless wars...<br><br>It's time for the sleeping princess to wake up and start her adventures in those worlds.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 80 characters to do battle with<br></li><li>Cutting-edge graphics to amaze your friends and neighbors with<br></li><li>A stunning digital soundtrack<br></li><li>Online multiplayer</li></ul>",
